/support/gitrepo.py b/datalad/support/gitrepo.py\nindex c542642e3..98a47a469 100644\n--- a/datalad/support/gitrepo.py\n+++ b/datalad/support/gitrepo.py\n@@ -449,12 +449,14 @@ def __init__(self, action):\n         self._pbar = None\n         self._op_code = None\n         GitPythonProgressBar._last_error_lines = None\n+        GitPythonProgressBar._last_other_lines = None\n \n     def __del__(self):\n         self.close()\n \n     def close(self):\n         GitPythonProgressBar._last_error_lines = self.error_lines\n+        GitPythonProgressBar._last_other_lines = self.other_lines\n         self._close_pbar()\n \n     def __enter__(self):\n```\n\n```sh\n#!/bin/sh\n\nset -eux\ncd \"$(mktemp -d --tmpdir dl-XXXXXXX)\"\ngit init ds\ndatalad clone ds ds0\n```\n\n```\n+ mktemp -d --tmpdir dl-XXXXXXX\n+ cd /tmp/dl-3CcNZ59\n+ git init ds\nInitialized empty Git repository in /tmp/dl-3CcNZ59/ds/.git/\n+ datalad clone ds ds0\n[INFO] Cloning dataset to \u003cDataset path=/tmp/dl-3CcNZ59/ds0\u003e \n[INFO] Attempting to clone from ds to /tmp/dl-3CcNZ59/ds0 \n[INFO] Completed clone attempts for \u003cDataset path=/tmp/dl-3CcNZ59/ds0\u003e \nother lines [\"Cloning into '/tmp/dl-3CcNZ59/ds0'...\", 'warning: You appear to have cloned an empty repository.', 'done.']\ninstall(ok): /tmp/dl-3CcNZ59/ds0 (dataset)\n```\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\nGiven that `clone` is being reworked without GitPython (gh-4080), I think it makes sense to see how that lands before thinking much about what to do here.\n\n[0]: https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/4038#issuecomment-576443059","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1580916273,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU4MjQ2MDM0Mg==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/4117#issuecomment-582460342"},"message":"I pushed a tentative fix into that PR.","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1580916281,"metadata"